{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["And he called the place — the place outside Luz where he had set up a monument when he came from his father's house." "El Bet-El — for originally the name of the city was Bet-El. But Luz was the city's name at first; however, now he called the place outside the city, where he had dreamed, Bet-El, El Bet-El, because until now he had been at Bet-El."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:46:13.259444016Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}